# Everything normalises as usual...
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary

# ...EXCEPT the map files, which MUST keep CRLF line endings — the EverQuest
# client will not read them otherwise. Marking them binary stops git normalising
# the bytes on commit or checkout, on any platform. This rule stays LAST because
# the last matching line wins, and the pattern stays quoted because of the spaces.
"Emoda Legends Maps/*.txt" -text
